WEBVTT

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.580
This scene again.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.160
What are you?

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:40.200
What are you trying to accomplish
by showing me this?

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.250
War...

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.540
I repeat.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:56.370
Across time, over every ocean,
I continue to fight.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.250
Endless war.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.000
This ocean engulfed in flame...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.160
...is my true, crimson lane.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.750
For you soon as well...

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:22.500
Good morning. Have you slept well?

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.120
Belfast...

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.370
It is time for breakfast.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.580
I don't need any.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:05.120
I insist. In order to lead
a healthy human life,

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.830
breakfast is mandatory.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:07.910
Stop.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.500
I would look like a fool
pretending to be human.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:22.790
The Sakura Empire has lost
some of its strength.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.450
It should take them some time to recover.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:29.370
Unfortunately, we aren't ready
to pounce on the opportunity either.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.620
The black Mental Cube, right?

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:35.000
And Enterprise, too.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.080
There are a mountain of issues.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.830
Did you learn anything?

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.830
Nothing. Totally stumped.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.790
"Light Aircraft Carrier <i>Langley</i> "

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:55.040
We don't know anything about
Mental Cubes in the first place.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:59.330
A literal black box, I see.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.330
"Destroyer Sports Day"

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:05.620
Is the glow getting stronger?

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.700
This item is related to the Sirens.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.660
We should assume this is a bad sign.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:15.200
If the Sirens are messing with my sister,
I won't let them get away with it.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.410
How is she doing?

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:19.330
She is concerned.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:24.080
Why does she have to suffer alone...?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:31.500
Why did Akagi cause so much trouble?!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.500
Akagi was the one
principally allied with the Sirens.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.790
With Akagi gone, I worry
about how Kaga will act.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.870
Is Sakura Empire okay...?

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.330
Too hot.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.660
Are you okay, Ayanami?
Want to get out now?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:10.120
I was just thinking.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.950
I am worried about my Sakura Empire friends.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.750
The Azur Lane people are all great.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.750
But the Sakura Empire members
are precious to me as well...

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:26.450
I want to save everyone there.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.120
Yes! Let's do it, Ayanami!

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:37.910
If they are important to you,
they are important to me.

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:40.870
I still don't know what to do, but...

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:44.200
It's okay. We were able to become friends.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.540
We should be able to do the same
with the Sakura Empire.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.200
Thank you, everyone.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.040
You want to seal Orochi away?!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.870
It is just a temporary pause to the project.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.290
With Akagi gone, we cannot move it forward.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.370
Who put this idea in your head?

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.870
The decision is mine and mine alone.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:12.790
Half measures, Nagato. Without Orochi,
Sakura Empire has no future.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.750
Kaga, you should rest as well.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:19.870
Akagi's absence has clearly
taken its toll on you.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.410
Rest and allow your heart to heal.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.080
Nagato...!

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.000
My decision is final. You are dismissed.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:37.330
This is starting to look troublesome.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.660
Project Orochi is put on hold.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.950
Mass-produced Sirens are still unresponsive.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.910
We're in a bind, that's what.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:52.620
I'm worried about Ayanami and Akashi as well.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.410
I hope they aren't feeling lonely.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.620
This whole plan was doomed from the start.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:04.040
We shouldn't be wagering our entire fate
on that thing we know nothing about.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.660
It's not that simple.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.200
The Red Axis is not a monolithic alliance.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.910
We don't want the Iron Blood
to see quite how weakened we are.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:20.200
The real enemy are the Sirens, you know.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:36.620
I wonder what we're going to do next.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:40.700
Nothing has changed.
We simply do what must be done.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.500
At the end of the day, the only thing
you can really trust is your own power.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.160
How are you feeling?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:49.830
I'm fine now. I can fight anytime.

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.790
That's good to hear.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.910
But the situation is not great.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.950
I fear it is not just the Sakura Empire...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:02.370
I fear everything is being
pushed toward some terrible fate.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.790
Then it's up to us to change that.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.330
I can't let them do all the work.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.500
We have to change as well.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:28.250
This scenery...

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:33.790
Dear sister Akagi?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.540
Dear sister Amagi.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.700
"Battlecruiser <i>Amagi</i> "

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:58.330
The cold evening wind is not good for you.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:04.910
I'm sorry. I felt well today.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:08.370
Look how pretty the cherry blossoms are.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:18.410
Even if I am gone,
my heart is always right here.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.620
Why so faint-hearted...?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:27.660
And my powers will be inherited
by the new children.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.950
We will be together forever, Akagi.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:50.580
At this rate, the Sakura Empire...
No, the entire world has no future.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:55.500
You need power. Power akin to the gods.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:10:00.830
This black Mental Cube collects
all forms of data and evolves.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:10.790
Data is will. Will is power.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.200
Especially for people like us.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:24.450
That's why the ship created from
the Black Box will have great powers.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:28.870
To reanimate the past and generate
whatever future you desire.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.160
Nonsense...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.660
You can create anything.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:37.250
Even the dead.

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:39.750
Nonsense.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.620
Oh? How hurtful.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:46.080
Even if it had the same appearance,
the same memories,

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.950
it would still be a mere reflection.

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.330
A shadow within a mirror image.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.790
You're wrong.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:57.660
If the shape and content are
the exact same, that is simply real.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.330
What is "real" anyway?

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:05.620
A newly repaired ship,
a collection of rotting woodwork...

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:11.370
Which is the Ship of Theseus?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:16.870
The only thing that matters
is that Amagi would be by your side.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:25.500
There is no place for me
beside dear sister Akagi.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.370
I have failed to even be a replacement.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.330
But it doesn't matter.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:36.200
Dear sister Akagi, your wishes are mine...

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.500
What are you...?!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:30.200
Humanity set sail into the oceans
with adventure in their hearts.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:34.950
But soon, that heart was filled by
a different desire: to conquer the seas.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.500
The history of the ocean is full of war.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:48.580
Conflict. That is humanity's true desire.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:52.080
That is the drama that humanity yearns for.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.040
What insanity is this...?!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.040
You're... different.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:15.000
That look, and the previous one--just fakes...

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.950
Your true nature is much more horrendous.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:20.290
No, I am real.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:24.450
For I am a mirror that reflects
the will of humankind.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.330
I am Orochi.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:33.870
A monster born from the will of humanity.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.750
Wait!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.370
I will take care of her from here.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.540
Are you sure? In that case, thank you.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.330
I...

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.500
You fell unconscious in the hallway.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:16.450
It is a direct result of your unhealthy lifestyle.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.950
Was I dreaming? No...

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.620
Leave me alone.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:37.700
There is clearly something wrong with me.
I cannot possibly be of any use now.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:47.870
Without the ability to fight, I am worthless.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:01.950
Huh?

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.870
W-Wait... Hey...

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:09.540
Wait, what is this?! Hey!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.080
S-Stop! Let go already!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.040
Are you listening to me?!

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:19.750
Huh, huh? What was that?

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.120
Surprised.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.450
I've never seen Belfast like that...

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.950
Morning. I overslept.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.540
H-Huh? What's going on?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.540
Lovers' quarrel?

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.540
Eat.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.450
I said I...

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:51.040
Eat.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.410
Y-Yes...

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:12.200
If you had a decent meal, you would not
be so preoccupied with negative thoughts.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:20.450
As I have mentioned before,
you do not favor fighting.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:26.580
Yes. I think I might be afraid of the ocean.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:31.620
But you still kept fighting. Why is that?

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:35.950
That's because... fighting is
the purpose of my existence.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.450
Stop falling back on easy answers.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:45.450
You already know the correct answer.
You have simply lost track of it.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.160
What was that?!

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:58.200
--Big sis!
--An attack?! Where?!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:03.330
The Sakura Empire, making a move now?
What were the patrols doing?!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.450
No, the enemy is...

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:08.950
The attack isn't coming from the ocean!

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:11.200
The enemy has infiltrated the base alone!

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.200
The enemy is...

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.870
...a Siren!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:29.290
Northampton!

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:35.580
I'm sorry... I couldn't stop the enemy.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.250
My ship again!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:43.160
Belfast and a few others are
in pursuit, but the enemy is...

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:47.950
I know. Who would have thought that
an upper-class Siren would come alone?

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.500
Enterprise?

00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.540
I...

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:13.120
Sh-She's too fast!

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.830
The enemy has stolen the black Mental Cube.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.830
We cannot let her get away.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.410
There's no way! She's too fast!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.950
I have a shot.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.290
Oh?

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.200
You did it!

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:42.120
What, does someone want to play?

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:42.120
"Purifier"

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:53.790
It's the eve of the big day! Let's party hard!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.080
Mass-produced Sirens, too?!

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:23.700
I can't let my sister do all the work!

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.500
Ayanami!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.750
Yes!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:54.660
We did it!

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:59.290
No!

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:09.790
Enterprise...!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.910
Hornet! Hold this position!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:27.410
If I am afraid of the ocean,
why do I keep fighting?

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.290
I'm going to die! I'm really going to die!

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:42.040
Come on now, how am I
supposed to enjoy this?

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.540
What?!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:55.910
Siren!

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:58.450
Ooh, it's Enterprise!

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:15.620
Sorry, Sakura Empire. I'll just help myself
to the secrets of the Orochi...

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.660
Kaga?!

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:26.790
Dear sister... I am on my way.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:33.160
What?!

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:52.870
What--What is this?!

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:03.370
Is Kaga doing this...?

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:06.910
What is that...?

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:13.870
Is that... Orochi?

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:21.410
Kaga!

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
